      "writtenOn": "2026-11-12T16:16:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Removing the initialization leaves it at zero, agreed. Could we also add `default: 0` to the interface YAML and document that zero means no component integrity information has been acquired yet? Otherwise, we\u0027re relying on generated initialization without defining what that value means to consumers. We should also confirm the Redfish mapping treats zero as unavailable rather than displaying an epoch timestamp.",
